WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.970
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.240 --> 00:06.640
When you decided to back out,

3
00:06.640 --> 00:08.000
why didn't you tell me right away?

4
00:08.000 --> 00:09.520
You ungrateful son.

5
00:09.840 --> 00:11.680
What are you doing? Can't you hear me?

6
00:12.200 --> 00:13.080
You should stop, Itt.

7
00:13.520 --> 00:15.000
Don't make things any worse.

8
00:15.160 --> 00:16.520
This is a very big deal.

9
00:16.520 --> 00:17.760
You really had no idea?

10
00:17.800 --> 00:20.160
The view from inside the room is different

11
00:20.520 --> 00:21.600
from the one up on the rooftop.

12
00:21.800 --> 00:23.080
Give Ing some time.

13
00:23.200 --> 00:25.040
No one gives a damn about me.

14
00:25.320 --> 00:26.880
They only care about what they can gain from me.

15
00:28.120 --> 00:29.560
I said, let go.

16
00:29.880 --> 00:31.480
What makes you think

17
00:32.080 --> 00:33.160
I'd ever submit to you?

18
00:33.320 --> 00:34.280
You idiot.

19
03:03.760 --> 03:06.760
I'm starving.

20
03:06.920 --> 03:08.240
Can you wait, then?

21
03:08.480 --> 03:10.480
I could wait an eternity.

22
03:10.960 --> 03:12.520
But you've got the key now.

23
03:12.560 --> 03:15.120
Just think of this place as your home.

24
03:15.400 --> 03:16.520
Come here.

25
03:16.600 --> 03:18.320
Your heart belongs to me.

26
03:18.480 --> 03:20.760
No matter where in the world you go,

27
03:21.079 --> 03:22.760
-you'll still be thinking of me. -Hey, what are you doing?

28
05:53.560 --> 05:56.159
Life's been a struggle for you lately, hasn't it?

29
05:56.400 --> 05:58.440
If you need anything, we can talk.

30
05:58.720 --> 06:00.240
Everything is negotiable.

31
06:00.240 --> 06:03.000
We're brothers after all.

32
06:03.280 --> 06:05.200
Listen to me, you little brat.

33
06:05.760 --> 06:07.040
Even if I'm drowning in debt,

34
06:07.040 --> 06:08.840
don't you dare think you'll get what's mine.

35
06:09.680 --> 06:10.760
In this lifetime,

36
06:10.800 --> 06:12.720
if I ever let a mistress's son like you be happy,

37
06:12.720 --> 06:14.040
you can call me every filthy name in the book.

38
06:20.880 --> 06:22.960
Dammit, it just never ends.

39
06:23.000 --> 06:25.280
[Dad]

40
06:31.960 --> 06:32.800
Yes, Dad.

41
06:33.440 --> 06:35.840
Ing, I'm at the office.

42
06:36.280 --> 06:38.440
Do you have some time to talk?

43
06:43.800 --> 06:44.800
Yeah.

44
06:59.280 --> 07:02.960
Ing, how long did you plan on keeping this from me?

45
07:11.400 --> 07:13.280
I'm not your favorite son,

46
07:14.080 --> 07:16.880
the type who runs crying to you whenever there's trouble.

47
07:20.880 --> 07:21.720
Right.

48
07:22.080 --> 07:23.880
Even if I wanted to tell you, I couldn't.

49
07:25.000 --> 07:27.000
The person who brought ruin

50
07:27.000 --> 07:28.760
upon his own wife and son

51
07:30.200 --> 07:31.680
was you, wasn't it?

52
07:37.240 --> 07:38.520
I already gave him a beating.

53
07:39.600 --> 07:41.280
I didn't hold back at all,

54
07:42.240 --> 07:43.760
but he wouldn't stop.

55
07:47.400 --> 07:49.920
You're at a disadvantage right now

56
07:50.760 --> 07:53.000
because you have to consider the future of the company

57
07:53.320 --> 07:55.680
and our family's interests.

58
07:57.159 --> 07:57.960
I see.

59
07:58.560 --> 08:01.160
The company? Our family?

60
08:01.600 --> 08:02.480
I get it now.

61
08:02.920 --> 08:04.720
So the reason you came here is...

62
08:04.840 --> 08:08.160
you want me to sell all my shares in the company, right?

63
08:09.240 --> 08:10.160
Ing,

64
08:11.040 --> 08:12.520
I can't just stand by

65
08:12.560 --> 08:14.120
and watch our business crumble

66
08:14.120 --> 08:15.520
just because you two are out for each other's throats.

67
08:17.520 --> 08:18.600
To be honest,

68
08:19.640 --> 08:21.320
you're absolutely right, Dad.

69
08:26.720 --> 08:27.880
As for my portion,

70
08:28.560 --> 08:29.840
I'll transfer all of it to you.

71
08:30.120 --> 08:32.039
And that private company I'm running,

72
08:32.600 --> 08:34.200
I'll hand that over to you as well.

73
08:35.799 --> 08:38.240
But if you insist on pushing like this,

74
08:38.960 --> 08:41.080
you'll bring the Adularaya family down with you.

75
08:42.799 --> 08:43.919
Yeah.

76
08:45.240 --> 08:46.840
You're completely right, Dad.

77
08:48.480 --> 08:50.520
Honestly, I'm not even hurt.

78
08:52.360 --> 08:53.600
Not at all.

79
08:54.400 --> 08:56.960
Your son is just so damn clever, isn't he?

80
08:59.000 --> 09:01.080
He's a real master of deception.

81
09:02.440 --> 09:04.800
I guess he really takes after his mom.

82
09:05.120 --> 09:06.160
Ing.

83
09:07.520 --> 09:09.600
Oh, that's right.

84
09:13.360 --> 09:15.040
Araya Group doesn't belong to me alone.

85
09:16.240 --> 09:18.520
That sixty-seven percent stake I hold...

86
09:19.480 --> 09:20.600
I can give it up.

87
09:22.880 --> 09:24.480
Because in the end,

88
09:24.640 --> 09:26.720
whether it's his or mine,

89
09:28.320 --> 09:30.280
it belongs to Araya Group anyway, doesn't it?

90
09:33.520 --> 09:35.080
Is there anything else he wants?

91
09:36.600 --> 09:38.000
I'll give it all to him.

92
09:42.160 --> 09:44.040
But I have one request.

93
09:53.400 --> 09:55.080
Alright. Let's hear it.

94
09:56.800 --> 09:58.200
I want you,

95
09:58.880 --> 10:00.760
your happy little family,

96
10:01.480 --> 10:02.920
your favorite son,

97
10:02.960 --> 10:04.600
and your mistress

98
10:05.200 --> 10:07.240
to get out of the house.

99
10:09.000 --> 10:11.560
That house belonged to my mom, didn't it?

100
10:15.280 --> 10:17.280
She was quite pathetic, wasn't she?

101
10:17.720 --> 10:19.080
She couldn't keep her own husband

102
10:19.120 --> 10:21.440
or even her own life.

103
10:22.960 --> 10:25.560
I'm the only one left to protect her memory.

104
10:27.960 --> 10:29.360
I will not allow a mistress's son

105
10:29.400 --> 10:31.000
to strut around my mom's house,

106
10:31.000 --> 10:32.560
acting like he owns the place.

107
10:35.840 --> 10:36.760
Dad,

108
10:38.000 --> 10:39.920
I won't let that homewrecker

109
10:40.080 --> 10:42.480
disrespect my mom ever again.

110
10:50.800 --> 10:52.440
I think I've said enough.

111
10:53.720 --> 10:54.880
You should leave now.

112
10:55.040 --> 10:56.920
Once I've cleared the paperwork,

113
10:57.520 --> 10:59.000
I'll let Itt know myself.

114
11:02.240 --> 11:03.480
Oh,

115
11:04.040 --> 11:05.040
I almost forgot.

116
11:05.240 --> 11:07.400
There's something I've been meaning to tell you.

117
11:09.880 --> 11:10.880
All this time,

118
11:10.920 --> 11:12.800
I've been carrying this entire company on my back,

119
11:14.160 --> 11:17.560
along with all the relatives waiting for my handouts.

120
11:20.040 --> 11:22.360
From now on, if anything happens to Araya Group,

121
11:22.400 --> 11:25.120
please don't even think about calling me again.

122
11:26.200 --> 11:28.720
I'm going to live my life for myself.

123
11:34.440 --> 11:35.840
I think you should take your leave.

124
11:36.080 --> 11:37.400
I'm too busy to see you out.

125
11:49.440 --> 11:50.720
Let's just say...

126
11:51.240 --> 11:52.040
it's a deal.

127
11:52.080 --> 11:55.240
I'll do exactly as you ask.

128
12:32.680 --> 12:33.760
Hello, P'Ing.

129
12:35.400 --> 12:36.880
Listen to me.

130
12:37.720 --> 12:39.160
If you want what's mine,

131
12:39.800 --> 12:41.600
I'll give it all to you.

132
12:41.960 --> 12:43.720
Not just half the shares,

133
12:43.920 --> 12:45.800
but all sixty-seven percent that I hold.

134
12:45.800 --> 12:47.040
Take every last bit of it.

135
12:47.440 --> 12:48.680
And after this,

136
12:48.840 --> 12:50.480
the company will be yours.

137
12:50.720 --> 12:53.320
You can run it into the ground for all I care.

138
12:53.600 --> 12:55.520
And I won't negotiate the price.

139
12:56.040 --> 12:58.520
You can have it for seventy percent of the market value.

140
12:59.720 --> 13:01.680
Have you really thought this through?

141
13:03.160 --> 13:04.560
Stop wasting your breath.

142
13:05.520 --> 13:07.720
But I won't be able to come up

143
13:07.720 --> 13:09.200
with that much cash immediately.

144
13:10.880 --> 13:13.040
And why exactly should that be my problem?

145
13:14.000 --> 13:16.000
I'll stop by the legal department today,

146
13:16.040 --> 13:17.440
sign the notices,

147
13:17.520 --> 13:18.840
and leave right after.

148
13:19.480 --> 13:21.080
Whenever you get the money,

149
13:21.760 --> 13:23.600
just contact them yourself.

150
13:26.800 --> 13:28.480
Don't you even want to see me?

151
13:34.760 --> 13:37.480
Do you really hate me that much?

152
13:48.760 --> 13:50.920
P'Piang, come in here for a moment.

153
14:04.880 --> 14:05.680
Yes, sir.

154
14:07.120 --> 14:08.920
I've just sold all of my shares,

155
14:08.960 --> 14:10.480
and I'm leaving today.

156
14:15.320 --> 14:17.080
Please have all the necessary paperwork

157
14:17.080 --> 14:18.440
ready for me to sign.

158
14:24.040 --> 14:25.080
What's with that look?

159
14:28.280 --> 14:29.320
I'm sorry

160
14:30.880 --> 14:33.600
that you have to get a new boss, Secretary Piang.

161
14:36.440 --> 14:37.600
The new guy might not have

162
14:37.640 --> 14:39.200
my taste or my looks.

163
14:39.240 --> 14:40.240
I'm sorry for that.

164
14:42.960 --> 14:44.440
You don't need to apologize to me.

165
14:45.280 --> 14:46.480
I've seen everything.

166
14:47.520 --> 14:49.720
You're just doing what's best for the company.

167
14:51.240 --> 14:52.080
I see.

168
14:54.160 --> 14:56.400
In the entire world right now,

169
14:57.720 --> 14:59.920
you're probably the only one who understands me.

170
15:03.160 --> 15:05.280
Araya Group won't be the same anymore

171
15:05.840 --> 15:07.840
without you.

172
15:09.440 --> 15:12.840
If you ever want to start over somewhere else,

173
15:13.200 --> 15:14.280
just say the word.

174
15:14.320 --> 15:15.280
Can I?

175
15:15.720 --> 15:17.680
Oh, for a secretary of your caliber,

176
15:17.720 --> 15:20.200
do you think I could even afford your salary?

177
15:24.680 --> 15:25.840
If you can't afford the salary,

178
15:25.840 --> 15:27.920
you can always pay me in shares instead.

179
15:28.720 --> 15:29.840
Smart answer.

180
15:30.400 --> 15:32.160
Anyway...

181
15:32.760 --> 15:34.480
please have Auntie Chai clean up the office.

182
15:34.560 --> 15:35.720
Understood.

183
15:36.000 --> 15:38.560
A messenger just delivered this.

184
15:40.480 --> 15:41.160
Alright.

185
15:41.600 --> 15:43.720
Please go get Auntie Chai

186
15:43.720 --> 15:44.920
to clean the office.

187
15:45.720 --> 15:46.440
Yes, sir.

188
15:52.560 --> 15:53.520
P'Piang.

189
16:00.160 --> 16:01.760
Let's meet again sometime.

190
16:06.640 --> 16:08.280
Yes, I'll see you later.

191
16:28.360 --> 16:30.560
Did you get it yet? Do you like it?

192
16:37.440 --> 16:39.920
Secretary Piang asked me to come and clean, sir.

193
16:39.960 --> 16:41.600
Yes. Well...

194
16:42.320 --> 16:44.320
I don't need anything in this room anymore.

195
16:44.960 --> 16:46.600
You're not keeping anything in here?

196
16:46.600 --> 16:47.720
Yeah, that's right.

197
16:50.080 --> 16:50.960
Uh...

198
16:51.200 --> 16:52.280
Auntie Chai.

199
16:52.520 --> 16:53.320
Here.

200
16:53.640 --> 16:54.760
It's yours.

201
16:55.600 --> 16:57.120
Thank you, Mr. CEO.

202
17:26.880 --> 17:27.839
Hello, Grandpa.

203
17:28.160 --> 17:30.320
Ing, stay right there.

204
17:30.600 --> 17:32.680
I'm having the driver take me to Bangkok.

205
17:32.720 --> 17:33.440
Wait,

206
17:33.440 --> 17:34.880
why are you coming here?

207
17:35.560 --> 17:37.680
Oh, hey, Grandpa.

208
17:38.200 --> 17:38.920
Don't be mad.

209
17:38.960 --> 17:40.080
You don't need to come.

210
17:40.080 --> 17:40.760
Just stay there.

211
17:40.760 --> 17:42.000
I'll go see you.

212
17:42.280 --> 17:43.960
How can I not be mad?

213
17:44.240 --> 17:45.840
If I don't handle this,

214
17:46.040 --> 17:48.160
those people will just kick you out.

215
17:48.720 --> 17:50.320
Like mother, like son.

216
17:50.360 --> 17:51.800
He's just like her.

217
17:52.240 --> 17:53.680
And as for Triyot,

218
17:53.960 --> 17:55.640
what kind of father is he?

219
17:55.800 --> 17:57.560
I'm going to teach him a lesson

220
17:57.600 --> 17:58.480
about what it means

221
17:58.520 --> 17:59.920
-Grandpa. -to be a father.

222
18:00.440 --> 18:01.960
Grandpa, calm down.

223
18:02.000 --> 18:03.320
Your blood pressure is going to spike.

224
18:03.600 --> 18:05.960
I've already made peace with this.

225
18:06.040 --> 18:07.280
Think about it.

226
18:07.440 --> 18:08.120
All this time,

227
18:08.160 --> 18:09.840
I've been carrying this whole company,

228
18:09.880 --> 18:11.640
always having to provide for all the relatives.

229
18:11.680 --> 18:12.680
If I sell it to him,

230
18:12.680 --> 18:14.720
I can live a comfortable life.

231
18:14.840 --> 18:16.560
I won't have to make money for anyone anymore.

232
18:16.680 --> 18:18.200
I just feel it's such a waste.

233
18:18.480 --> 18:21.400
You worked so hard to build this company.

234
18:21.400 --> 18:23.920
How can you give it away to someone else so easily?

235
18:25.880 --> 18:28.600
Grandpa, the company is just a shell.

236
18:29.040 --> 18:32.600
In reality, it's the people that matter.

237
18:32.920 --> 18:35.680
Grandpa, trust me.

238
18:36.040 --> 18:37.200
In the blink of an eye,

239
18:37.200 --> 18:40.320
I'll build a company ten times bigger than Araya Group.

240
18:40.360 --> 18:41.480
I need you to trust me.

241
18:41.600 --> 18:43.160
Of course.

242
18:43.520 --> 18:45.400
I always trust you.

243
18:45.920 --> 18:47.800
Stop being mad, okay?

244
18:47.840 --> 18:49.440
And there's no need to come here.

245
18:49.480 --> 18:50.720
If you make yourself sick getting mad,

246
18:50.760 --> 18:52.600
it won't be worth it.

247
18:53.000 --> 18:53.800
Grandpa,

248
18:54.640 --> 18:55.840
I have to go now.

249
18:55.880 --> 18:57.200
I have an urgent matter.

250
18:57.360 --> 18:58.720
Let's just say that from now on,

251
18:58.840 --> 19:01.560
I'll have plenty of time to talk to you.

252
19:04.320 --> 19:05.320
Hanging up now.

253
19:32.760 --> 19:33.360
Hello.

254
19:33.360 --> 19:34.440
-Hello. -Hello.

255
19:35.920 --> 19:37.960
Since you're bold enough to make this proposal,

256
19:38.000 --> 19:39.400
I'll give you a chance.

257
19:40.400 --> 19:42.520
Just don't let me down.

258
19:42.720 --> 19:43.920
I won't.

259
19:44.160 --> 19:44.800
Let me tell you,

260
19:44.840 --> 19:46.960
luxury style is old-fashioned now.

261
19:46.960 --> 19:48.040
These days, it has to be cozy.

262
19:48.040 --> 19:49.080
I want clients to feel at home

263
19:49.080 --> 19:50.280
right when they enter the place, like...

264
19:50.320 --> 19:51.880
This is what the new generation

265
19:51.920 --> 19:53.280
actually prefers.

266
21:39.560 --> 21:40.400
Those in favor of

267
21:40.440 --> 21:42.400
the land development

268
21:42.400 --> 21:43.600
for a resort in northern Phuket,

269
21:43.600 --> 21:45.040
please raise your hands.

270
21:52.320 --> 21:55.680
[Land Purchase Agreement]

271
21:55.720 --> 21:58.680
[Buyer: Tottiwa Adularaya]

272
21:59.760 --> 22:01.560
The most important thing is this.

273
22:03.120 --> 22:04.240
Mr. Jettana,

274
22:04.240 --> 22:05.520
I'll be blunt.

275
22:06.080 --> 22:06.960
Ing's brother

276
22:06.960 --> 22:08.560
has bought up all the creditor companies

277
22:08.560 --> 22:10.240
for the Phuket land.

278
22:11.280 --> 22:12.960
Once Mr. Ing purchased the land,

279
22:13.280 --> 22:16.360
what awaited him was billions in penalty fees.

280
22:16.760 --> 22:17.960
You're riding a tiger now.

281
22:18.440 --> 22:21.120
Even if you want to get off, you can't.

282
22:24.120 --> 22:25.000
I guess Director Jettana

283
22:25.040 --> 22:27.200
was keeping this as insurance,

284
22:27.200 --> 22:28.960
but he uploaded it by mistake.

285
22:29.600 --> 22:31.320
No one has clean hands.

286
22:31.800 --> 22:33.120
It's a total mess.

287
22:34.960 --> 22:36.600
This is enough to turn the tables.

288
22:36.800 --> 22:38.200
Thank you so much, P'Phu.

289
22:38.320 --> 22:39.720
I'll handle the rest.

290
23:36.880 --> 23:37.880
Who's that?

291
23:38.920 --> 23:40.120
Who the hell are you?

292
23:40.160 --> 23:41.080
What are you doing here?

293
23:47.360 --> 23:48.800
I've been waiting for you

294
23:49.240 --> 23:50.520
to come home.

295
23:51.640 --> 23:52.480
Home?

296
23:54.320 --> 23:55.880
This place isn't my home.

297
23:57.080 --> 23:58.400
It's just a piece of property.

298
24:00.560 --> 24:01.680
You really are something.

299
24:02.120 --> 24:03.640
Not only did you embezzle my money,

300
24:04.960 --> 24:06.840
but you also stole my clothes to wear.

301
24:06.880 --> 24:08.560
Do you have any shame at all?

302
24:09.000 --> 24:10.040
You can get out now.

303
24:10.120 --> 24:11.440
I'm selling this place tomorrow.

304
24:13.200 --> 24:14.400
You're going to sell it?

305
24:17.440 --> 24:18.560
Yeah, I am.

306
24:19.480 --> 24:21.320
Forty million. You buying?

307
24:22.560 --> 24:23.840
Oh...

308
24:23.880 --> 24:26.080
I guess that's just pocket change for you now.

309
24:26.240 --> 24:28.080
You're rolling in it lately, aren't you?

310
24:28.080 --> 24:29.840
Must be nice after you and Itt ripped me off.

311
24:29.880 --> 24:31.320
You can easily afford this.

312
24:32.440 --> 24:33.320
Fine.

313
24:36.520 --> 24:37.400
I'll buy it.

314
24:40.840 --> 24:41.600
Junior.

315
24:41.840 --> 24:43.200
-Yes? -Pack my things on the second floor.

316
24:43.240 --> 24:44.440
Pack all of my clothes.

317
24:47.040 --> 24:48.000
Bring the bag, too.

318
24:57.640 --> 24:58.680
Junior?

319
25:00.160 --> 25:01.760
Is he the Junior you called?

320
25:02.760 --> 25:04.440
You said you weren't in touch with him anymore.

321
25:14.680 --> 25:15.800
I lied to you.

322
25:15.800 --> 25:16.880
You were just too stupid.

323
25:17.600 --> 25:18.440
Why?

324
25:19.400 --> 25:20.280
What I did

325
25:20.280 --> 25:21.800
is nothing compared to what you did to me.

326
25:21.800 --> 25:22.680
Let me tell you that.

327
25:25.960 --> 25:27.080
Go on. Don't be afraid.

328
25:28.120 --> 25:28.760
Okay.

329
25:28.960 --> 25:29.760
Go.

330
25:30.560 --> 25:31.080
He's just a nerd.

331
25:31.080 --> 25:32.200
What are you afraid of? Come on.

332
25:32.400 --> 25:33.600
Go pack my things.

333
25:34.640 --> 25:35.320
Alright.

334
25:40.560 --> 25:41.680
Who said you could go in?

335
25:41.720 --> 25:43.960
Who do you think you are, messing with my boy?

336
25:46.880 --> 25:48.200
Pack the clothes upstairs.

337
25:48.560 --> 25:49.360
Now.

338
25:49.560 --> 25:50.480
Alright.

339
25:55.200 --> 25:56.320
Are you dating him?

340
25:56.560 --> 25:57.920
We haven't even broken up yet.

341
25:59.680 --> 26:01.040
What a load of rubbish.

342
26:04.080 --> 26:04.800
Hurry it up.

343
26:04.800 --> 26:06.040
I don't want to stay here any longer.

344
26:07.960 --> 26:10.080
P'Ing, please don't go.

345
26:12.160 --> 26:13.480
Everything you said...

346
26:13.520 --> 26:14.680
was completely right.

347
26:16.440 --> 26:17.960
I was too full of myself.

348
26:18.920 --> 26:20.840
Please give me a chance to make it up to you.

349
26:22.560 --> 26:24.000
The only way you can make it up to me

350
26:24.040 --> 26:25.480
is to get the hell out of my sight.

351
26:25.520 --> 26:26.960
I'm sick of you.

352
26:28.760 --> 26:29.600
P'Ing...

353
26:30.920 --> 26:31.520
I've got proof

354
26:31.520 --> 26:32.760
that Itt framed P'Phet

355
26:32.800 --> 26:35.920
and stole the company's trade secrets.

356
26:35.960 --> 26:38.080
Do you think I'm a complete idiot?

357
26:38.920 --> 26:41.520
You think everyone is stupid enough to believe your lies?

358
26:42.160 --> 26:43.800
You've lied to me time and time again.

359
26:44.440 --> 26:46.880
What makes you think I'd trust you this time?

360
26:51.760 --> 26:52.520
Are you done yet?

361
26:52.520 --> 26:53.800
P'Ing, hey.

362
26:53.880 --> 26:54.960
Look at the evidence first.

363
26:54.960 --> 26:56.720
I told you, I'm done with this.

364
26:58.400 --> 26:59.480
Listen to me.

365
27:00.080 --> 27:01.480
I'm not going to care about anything anymore.

366
27:01.520 --> 27:02.320
Not you,

367
27:02.560 --> 27:03.720
Itt, or Pite.

368
27:03.720 --> 27:04.960
I'm done with all of you.

369
27:05.000 --> 27:05.640
Dammit.

370
27:06.040 --> 27:07.280
After everything I've done for you,

371
27:07.320 --> 27:09.120
this is what I get in return?

372
27:09.280 --> 27:10.440
You'd better listen closely.

373
27:10.480 --> 27:11.680
From now on, my life...

374
27:11.680 --> 27:12.920
is mine alone.

375
27:13.120 --> 27:14.640
I'll only care about myself.

376
27:14.960 --> 27:16.200
None of you will have a chance.

377
27:18.000 --> 27:19.560
Junior, get down here.

378
27:19.600 --> 27:20.760
Forget the stuff. Just throw it away.

379
27:20.800 --> 27:21.800
I'll just buy new ones.

380
27:28.240 --> 27:29.320
I don't want this, either.

381
27:29.320 --> 27:30.520
I'm replacing everything.

382
27:30.880 --> 27:31.880
Come with me.

383
27:35.080 --> 27:36.840
This is so damn annoying.

384
27:37.600 --> 27:38.200
Come on.

385
27:40.280 --> 27:40.960
Junior...

386
27:45.680 --> 27:46.680
Let go of me.

387
27:50.000 --> 27:50.800
P'Ing,

388
27:51.080 --> 27:52.880
you forced your way into my life.

389
27:53.320 --> 27:55.440
You can't just walk out on me like this.

390
27:55.880 --> 27:56.760
Let me go.

391
28:09.280 --> 28:10.040
P'Ing.

392
28:10.680 --> 28:11.440
Hey.

393
28:12.640 --> 28:13.480
P'Ing...

394
28:15.080 --> 28:15.920
P'Ing.

395
28:19.640 --> 28:20.520
Let's go.

396
28:23.680 --> 28:24.480
P'Ing...

397
28:30.360 --> 28:31.640
Secretary Piang...

398
28:32.480 --> 28:34.600
Auntie, Mr. Ing gave this to you.

399
28:34.640 --> 28:35.680
Please just take it.

400
28:36.320 --> 28:37.680
I really can't.

401
28:37.720 --> 28:39.400
I really can't accept this.

402
28:39.600 --> 28:41.440
Please give it back to him for me.

403
28:41.440 --> 28:44.480
But I doubt he will take it back.

404
28:46.280 --> 28:47.320
Yok, what are you doing here?

405
28:47.720 --> 28:49.520
P'Piang, where's P'Ing?

406
28:50.680 --> 28:52.200
I'm afraid I can't tell you that.

407
28:53.880 --> 28:55.680
Please, I'm begging you.

408
28:55.800 --> 28:57.240
I have plenty of evidence

409
28:57.280 --> 28:58.560
that can take Itt down.

410
28:58.600 --> 28:59.720
It's too late, Yok.

411
29:00.640 --> 29:02.880
Mr. Ing already signed over all his shares.

412
29:04.320 --> 29:05.520
He signed over his shares?

413
29:07.040 --> 29:08.920
His father came by this afternoon.

414
29:09.800 --> 29:11.520
I don't know what they discussed,

415
29:11.520 --> 29:12.760
but after that,

416
29:13.000 --> 29:14.520
Mr. Ing signed everything over

417
29:14.520 --> 29:16.280
to Mr. Itt.

418
29:18.440 --> 29:19.600
It's too late, Yok.

419
29:23.600 --> 29:24.800
Now, if you'll excuse me.

420
29:28.640 --> 29:30.960
Yok, could you take this?

421
29:33.720 --> 29:35.560
I don't know what's gotten into the CEO today.

422
29:35.600 --> 29:38.200
He just tossed this at me and walked off.

423
29:38.400 --> 29:39.680
I took a look inside

424
29:39.720 --> 29:40.960
and nearly had a heart attack.

425
29:41.080 --> 29:42.040
It's so expensive.

426
29:42.360 --> 29:44.080
I couldn't possibly keep it.

427
29:44.200 --> 29:46.560
Please return it to him for me.

428
29:46.880 --> 29:47.800
I'll take my leave now.

429
30:54.360 --> 30:55.200
Hello?

430
30:55.320 --> 30:56.200
Hello.

431
30:58.600 --> 30:59.720
Why are you the one answering?

432
30:59.760 --> 31:00.760
Where's Dad?

433
31:02.120 --> 31:03.280
He's out.

434
31:03.360 --> 31:05.680
He's picking up the relatives who are arriving.

435
31:07.000 --> 31:08.040
Picking them up for what?

436
31:08.880 --> 31:10.200
Oh, my goodness.

437
31:10.480 --> 31:12.440
I forgot to tell you. We're not having dinner at home

438
31:12.480 --> 31:13.960
this New Year's.

439
31:14.320 --> 31:16.480
Itt booked a dining room elsewhere

440
31:16.480 --> 31:19.040
specifically to host the relatives.

441
31:19.240 --> 31:20.920
I'll send you the location.

442
31:41.840 --> 31:44.680
I've been telling you that Itt is a good son.

443
31:44.720 --> 31:46.600
Oh, it's a Birkin.

444
31:46.600 --> 31:49.720
-So luxurious. -Oh, I love it.

445
31:49.760 --> 31:51.040
-I'm so jealous. -Congrats, Mom.

446
31:51.040 --> 31:52.400
-Isn't it pretty? -Yes.

447
31:52.440 --> 31:53.800
No need to be jealous.

448
31:53.840 --> 31:55.240
I told you.

449
31:55.280 --> 31:56.280
Let's eat.

450
31:57.160 --> 31:57.840
-Come on. -Alright.

451
31:57.880 --> 31:59.160
Things are going to get busy for you,

452
31:59.160 --> 32:00.680
so make sure you take care of yourself.

453
32:00.680 --> 32:01.200
Thank you, Mom.

454
32:01.200 --> 32:02.280
Exactly, Itt.

455
32:03.960 --> 32:05.520
-That's right. -Yeah.

456
32:06.360 --> 32:10.280
-Congratulations, Itt. -Congratulations. Well done.

457
32:11.040 --> 32:12.840
Don't let them outshine you.

458
32:12.960 --> 32:15.000
Itt, try some of the shrimp.

459
32:15.240 --> 32:15.920
From now on,

460
32:15.920 --> 32:19.320
my husband and I will have to rely on you.

461
32:19.920 --> 32:20.840
Cheers, honey.

462
32:22.520 --> 32:23.400
Eat up, son.

463
32:38.200 --> 32:41.520
Oh, Ing. You're here?

464
32:41.840 --> 32:42.800
Come on in.

465
32:43.920 --> 32:46.080
Ing, why are you here so late?

466
32:46.080 --> 32:47.240
It's my fault.

467
32:47.840 --> 32:48.800
I was caught up with things,

468
32:48.840 --> 32:50.720
so I forgot to let him know.

469
32:51.240 --> 32:53.840
Excuse me? Please get us one more seat.

470
32:56.360 --> 32:57.760
Oh, yeah?

471
32:59.720 --> 33:01.160
You forgot to tell me?

472
33:07.120 --> 33:08.400
I suppose mistresses

473
33:08.400 --> 33:10.800
love doing things behind everyone's back.

474
33:11.120 --> 33:11.800
Ing.

475
33:15.800 --> 33:16.920
Arisara,

476
33:17.560 --> 33:18.840
let me tell you something.

477
33:20.280 --> 33:22.080
You could win against my mom,

478
33:22.200 --> 33:24.680
move into this family,

479
33:25.080 --> 33:27.200
and even bear my dad a son.

480
33:28.680 --> 33:30.600
But at the end of the day, everyone in this room

481
33:32.560 --> 33:35.240
will see you as a mistress for the rest of your life.

482
33:35.280 --> 33:37.320
Ing, that's enough.

483
33:38.120 --> 33:39.440
Shut your mouth right now.

484
33:41.320 --> 33:42.320
Exactly, Ing.

485
33:43.360 --> 33:44.880
You're being rude.

486
33:45.280 --> 33:46.120
Yeah.

487
33:46.680 --> 33:49.680
It's New Year's. Let's not dig up the past.

488
33:57.800 --> 33:58.920
Damn.

489
34:00.760 --> 34:02.680
This family is unbelievable.

490
34:04.720 --> 34:05.360
Fine.

491
34:05.840 --> 34:07.920
If you love sucking up to them, please carry on.

492
34:07.960 --> 34:09.800
Logic clearly isn't welcome here.

493
34:09.920 --> 34:11.639
-Hey. -What?

494
34:11.960 --> 34:12.679
Are you ashamed?

495
34:16.280 --> 34:18.000
I'm really sorry. It's just that...

496
34:20.880 --> 34:23.280
no one ever taught me any manners

497
34:24.280 --> 34:25.679
since my mom died young.

498
34:26.280 --> 34:28.000
Please don't take offense.

499
34:32.120 --> 34:32.800
Itt,

500
34:34.800 --> 34:35.760
regarding the shares,

501
34:36.600 --> 34:37.480
I'll give you a discount.

502
34:39.159 --> 34:40.719
Think of it as your mom's fee

503
34:40.719 --> 34:42.280
that my dad never paid.

504
34:47.480 --> 34:48.600
Enjoy your meal.

505
34:59.360 --> 35:01.960
I'll go see him out.

506
35:02.480 --> 35:03.440
Itt...

507
35:03.960 --> 35:04.680
It's fine.

508
35:04.920 --> 35:06.000
I'm okay, Mom.

509
35:06.960 --> 35:08.880
Please enjoy the rest of your dinner.

510
35:09.480 --> 35:10.200
It's okay.

511
35:13.400 --> 35:14.400
It's going to be okay.

512
35:20.560 --> 35:22.720
Ing is just unbelievable.

513
35:27.600 --> 35:28.320
P'Ing.

514
35:28.680 --> 35:29.720
What now?

515
36:19.240 --> 36:21.400
[My Capy, from now on,]

516
36:21.440 --> 36:24.040
[I'll cherish you and take care of you the best I can.]

517
36:32.240 --> 36:34.120
If I gave you a ring, would you take it?

518
36:34.400 --> 36:35.720
What did you just say?

519
36:36.120 --> 36:38.760
Nothing. Just telling you to get home safe.

520
36:44.600 --> 36:46.640
[My Capy, from now on,]

521
36:46.680 --> 36:49.640
[I'll cherish you and take care of you the best I can.]

522
38:02.600 --> 38:03.680
Hello, P'Phu.

523
38:04.280 --> 38:06.200
Could you track the location of P'Ing's phone for me?

524
38:06.400 --> 38:07.960
I need to know where he is.

525
38:08.160 --> 38:09.480
I'll give you his number.

526
38:09.560 --> 38:10.640
Whoa, hold on.

527
38:10.640 --> 38:12.200
You think I'm in the FBI or something?

528
38:12.600 --> 38:13.760
Tracking a location and digging for data

529
38:13.800 --> 38:15.040
are two different things.

530
38:15.240 --> 38:17.360
If I get caught, I'm going straight to prison.

531
38:17.720 --> 38:19.240
So that means you can do it, right?

532
38:20.160 --> 38:21.600
I'm begging you, P'Phu.

533
38:21.600 --> 38:22.680
Please help me.

534
38:22.840 --> 38:23.720
Fine, fine.

535
38:23.720 --> 38:25.640
I'm only going to try.

536
38:25.640 --> 38:26.880
No guarantees, okay?

537
38:26.920 --> 38:28.880
Okay. Thank you so much.

538
38:38.160 --> 38:38.800
[System: No SIM]

539
39:10.280 --> 39:11.360
You're awake?

540
39:13.600 --> 39:14.400
Itt?

541
39:15.440 --> 39:16.880
What the hell are you doing?

542
39:18.600 --> 39:20.280
This is the first building of yours and Yok's.

543
39:20.600 --> 39:22.040
I decorated it myself.

544
39:22.760 --> 39:23.960
How do you like it?

545
39:25.480 --> 39:26.680
What are you trying to do?

546
39:27.520 --> 39:28.520
Let me go.

547
39:31.920 --> 39:34.200
P'Ing, I just wanted to talk to you,

548
39:34.440 --> 39:37.800
but you wouldn't even look at me anymore.

549
39:41.480 --> 39:42.440
Who do you think you are?

550
39:42.440 --> 39:43.960
Why should I look at you?

551
39:44.880 --> 39:45.800
Let me go.

552
39:47.400 --> 39:48.920
If you think I used to bully you,

553
39:48.960 --> 39:50.120
you've already had your revenge.

554
39:59.880 --> 40:01.640
Now that you've taken everything from me,

555
40:01.640 --> 40:03.000
isn't it enough?

556
40:09.440 --> 40:10.280
P'Ing...

557
40:11.520 --> 40:13.520
If this were just about revenge,

558
40:14.080 --> 40:15.880
I wouldn't be suffering this much.

559
40:17.360 --> 40:19.000
The way I feel about you...

560
40:19.440 --> 40:20.880
is more than just that.

561
40:23.480 --> 40:24.960
Have you lost your mind?

562
40:25.880 --> 40:27.080
What do you mean, you're suffering?

563
40:27.440 --> 40:28.600
The way you feel about me?

564
40:29.280 --> 40:30.680
Let me go right now.

565
40:35.120 --> 40:35.800
Do you remember

566
40:35.800 --> 40:37.360
the first time we met?

567
40:38.760 --> 40:41.560
I must have been about five years old then.

568
40:45.120 --> 40:48.160
Mom told me to say hi to you, but I was too afraid...

569
40:49.760 --> 40:53.120
because the way you looked at me was terrifying.

570
40:59.240 --> 41:00.960
I don't know if you remember,

571
41:03.800 --> 41:05.240
but in all my life,

572
41:07.200 --> 41:08.480
I will never forget.

573
41:16.360 --> 41:18.520
Welcome to your new home.

574
41:19.800 --> 41:22.160
You were wearing a white shirt.

575
41:27.800 --> 41:29.840
The first glimpse I caught of you,

576
41:30.960 --> 41:32.640
I just felt that...

577
41:33.720 --> 41:35.240
you were so beautiful.

578
41:38.120 --> 41:40.800
So beautiful I couldn't take my eyes off you.

579
41:42.160 --> 41:43.960
I couldn't help but wonder,

580
41:44.440 --> 41:46.600
if I had behaved a little better,

581
41:47.080 --> 41:48.880
would you have liked me back?

582
41:50.320 --> 41:52.120
Would you have stopped picking on me?

583
41:56.720 --> 41:58.800
-People are funny, aren't they? -Why are you following me?

584
41:59.000 --> 42:00.520
-As time passed, -Are you crazy?

585
42:00.760 --> 42:02.120
I grew used to it.

586
42:02.880 --> 42:05.080
Before I knew it, I loved every moment

587
42:05.840 --> 42:07.280
spent staring at you

588
42:08.400 --> 42:09.960
and following you around.

589
42:10.680 --> 42:13.560
You were so mean when we were kids.

590
42:14.640 --> 42:15.920
There was that one time

591
42:16.480 --> 42:18.160
you were going to teach me how to swim.

592
42:23.680 --> 42:25.440
But you just threw me into the pool.

593
42:30.120 --> 42:31.720
You almost killed me.

594
42:42.480 --> 42:43.880
Don't be such a wimp.

595
42:43.920 --> 42:44.800
The water only reaches your chest.

596
42:44.800 --> 42:45.680
Itt.

597
42:46.760 --> 42:48.880
Pull my son out of there right now.

598
42:51.840 --> 42:52.800
It's alright, sweetie.

599
42:57.880 --> 42:59.640
Are you okay, sweetie?

600
42:59.920 --> 43:01.720
I wanted to cry so badly.

601
43:01.920 --> 43:03.440
But I was too afraid to cry in front of you.

602
43:03.480 --> 43:04.800
Don't let him teach you anything now.

603
43:05.000 --> 43:06.320
-Because if I did, -How are you?

604
43:06.560 --> 43:07.840
-you would only get angrier. -Are you hurt?

605
43:09.040 --> 43:10.560
In my mind,

606
43:11.120 --> 43:13.320
you were nothing but a cruel monster.

607
43:15.360 --> 43:17.200
I couldn't help but stare at you,

608
43:18.320 --> 43:19.600
but every time I did,

609
43:20.400 --> 43:21.920
I just wanted to run away and hide.

610
43:28.320 --> 43:29.960
-Yet you protected me quite often. -Give it back.

611
43:30.000 --> 43:30.960
Give it back to me.

612
43:31.160 --> 43:32.680
-Give it back. -There was this one time...

613
43:32.680 --> 43:33.520
Give it to me.

614
43:33.520 --> 43:34.600
-Your brother? -When I just started primary school...

615
43:34.600 --> 43:35.440
He's a hero?

616
43:35.480 --> 43:37.480
-I was being bullied by my friends, -Give it back to me.

617
43:37.520 --> 43:39.280
but you stood up for me.

618
43:40.160 --> 43:42.800
He's my brother. Only I can mess with him.

619
43:45.160 --> 43:46.160
You want some more?

620
43:54.960 --> 43:56.520
You drew me looking so ugly.

621
44:03.080 --> 44:03.960
I used to wonder

622
44:04.000 --> 44:05.960
what was so great about being your brother.

623
44:06.160 --> 44:07.760
You'd even hit me sometimes.

624
44:11.480 --> 44:14.640
But deep down, I felt an inexplicable sense of joy,

625
44:16.040 --> 44:17.880
even though you never admitted

626
44:17.920 --> 44:19.560
that I was your brother.

627
44:22.800 --> 44:26.280
I was scared of you, but I also respected you so much.

628
44:30.800 --> 44:32.640
You're good at everything, so I thought that

629
44:32.920 --> 44:34.080
if I could just...

630
44:42.920 --> 44:43.920
If...

631
44:50.120 --> 44:51.400
Let go of me.

632
44:52.360 --> 44:53.760
You know I didn't do anything wrong.

633
44:53.960 --> 44:55.680
I was only a bit hard on you.

634
45:04.160 --> 45:05.320
I'm sorry.

635
45:06.520 --> 45:07.760
Happy now?

636
45:11.880 --> 45:14.160
If you keep your eyes on someone long enough,

637
45:14.160 --> 45:16.040
especially someone as hot as you,

638
45:19.520 --> 45:20.840
you eventually find yourself

639
45:20.880 --> 45:22.840
unable to look away.

640
45:28.840 --> 45:30.040
All these years,

641
45:30.600 --> 45:31.920
you've been the only one on my mind.

642
45:33.080 --> 45:33.800
Your flings

643
45:33.800 --> 45:34.880
and even Yok...

644
45:35.120 --> 45:37.000
All of them combined could never love you as much as I do.

645
45:38.280 --> 45:39.760
If I could go back in time,

646
45:40.680 --> 45:43.080
I never would've let Yok set foot in our home.

647
45:44.120 --> 45:44.960
Itt,

648
45:45.800 --> 45:47.080
do you realize what you're saying?

649
45:47.120 --> 45:48.200
Are you out of your mind?

650
45:50.000 --> 45:50.960
I do.

651
46:01.520 --> 46:03.360
I've kept this rope for a very long time.

652
46:04.040 --> 46:05.520
Guess it can't hold you anymore.

653
46:06.560 --> 46:07.680
What a pity.

654
46:08.200 --> 46:10.120
It's packed with so many memories.

655
46:14.320 --> 46:15.200
Damn...

656
46:15.800 --> 46:17.120
You should just use this rope

657
46:17.120 --> 46:19.080
to hang yourself, you pervert.

658
46:20.920 --> 46:22.000
Don't move.

659
46:22.720 --> 46:23.960
Your skin is all chafed.

660
46:25.760 --> 46:26.480
Itt,

661
46:26.720 --> 46:28.680
I don't know what you're trying to do,

662
46:28.920 --> 46:29.960
but if you stop now,

663
46:30.000 --> 46:31.840
I'll pretend like this never happened.

664
46:31.960 --> 46:33.520
And I won't hold any of this against you.

665
46:33.760 --> 46:35.520
Are you even listening to me?

666
46:38.120 --> 46:38.920
Let me go.

667
46:41.840 --> 46:42.720
Damn...

668
46:44.400 --> 46:45.640
I suppose so.

669
46:48.560 --> 46:50.200
If Yok hadn't come between us,

670
46:51.400 --> 46:53.800
I might've waited a few more years.

671
46:55.480 --> 46:58.400
But I can't take it anymore.

672
46:59.720 --> 47:01.680
I can't stand seeing you two in love.

673
47:03.200 --> 47:03.800
Hey.

674
47:04.000 --> 47:05.040
What are you doing?

675
47:05.480 --> 47:06.920
As long as I can make you mine...

676
47:06.960 --> 47:07.720
Itt...

677
47:08.040 --> 47:09.280
I don't care about anything else.

678
47:09.880 --> 47:11.120
What the hell are you doing?

679
47:18.200 --> 47:19.120
Hey...

680
47:23.920 --> 47:25.360
What the hell are you trying to do?

681
47:27.920 --> 47:28.880
Itt,

682
47:29.200 --> 47:30.840
are you insane?

683
47:31.200 --> 47:31.960
Hey.

684
47:32.520 --> 47:33.360
You'd better think this through.

685
47:33.400 --> 47:34.960
I'm your brother.

686
47:40.680 --> 47:42.200
I know, brother.

687
47:43.360 --> 47:44.960
But don't you want to try?

688
47:46.800 --> 47:48.520
Since you're always up for trying new things,

689
47:50.360 --> 47:51.320
you might actually enjoy it

690
47:52.480 --> 47:53.920
once you give it a try.

691
47:55.760 --> 47:57.280
Like hell I will.

692
49:01.680 --> 49:03.560
You're still wearing this scent, aren't you?

693
49:05.440 --> 49:06.400
You know what?

694
49:07.480 --> 49:08.640
Just catching a whiff of it,

695
49:09.600 --> 49:11.080
and I'm already hard.

696
49:11.120 --> 49:12.000
You pervert.

697
49:12.120 --> 49:12.800
Damn it.

698
49:12.920 --> 49:15.320
Have you lost your damn mind?

699
49:15.360 --> 49:16.800
I'm your freaking brother,

700
49:16.880 --> 49:17.840
for God's sake.

701
49:19.760 --> 49:20.800
Stop it, Itt.

702
49:22.000 --> 49:22.760
Itt...

703
49:23.120 --> 49:24.160
Stop it.

704
49:24.880 --> 49:25.720
Itt...

705
49:26.520 --> 49:27.720
I told you to stop.

706
49:47.200 --> 49:48.400
Hello, P'Ing?

707
49:48.920 --> 49:49.880
Where are you?

708
49:50.760 --> 49:52.200
I'm his brother.

709
49:52.840 --> 49:54.280
He's busy right now.

710
49:54.280 --> 49:55.680
Put him on the phone.

711
49:56.040 --> 49:57.640
You have no right to speak for him.

712
49:58.000 --> 49:59.800
What goes on between us is none of your business.

713
50:00.200 --> 50:02.400
He had too much to drink with the relatives,

714
50:03.840 --> 50:05.560
so I'm about to take him home.

715
50:07.360 --> 50:08.600
He doesn't want to see you.

716
50:09.320 --> 50:10.520
Stop calling him.

717
50:16.080 --> 50:16.920
Yok.

718
50:18.520 --> 50:19.800
Who the hell do you think you are?

719
50:20.360 --> 50:22.040
You're just a fling for him.

720
50:22.760 --> 50:24.360
He'll forget you in no time.

721
50:24.880 --> 50:26.640
Don't go thinking you're special.

722
50:27.640 --> 50:28.560
Let me go, Itt.

723
50:28.560 --> 50:29.200
Help me.

724
50:52.680 --> 50:54.360
Do you really think he can save you?

725
50:55.360 --> 50:56.600
Let me tell you something.

726
50:57.640 --> 50:58.680
Not a chance.

727
50:59.240 --> 51:00.880
He'll never find this place.

728
51:02.720 --> 51:03.520
Itt,

729
51:03.800 --> 51:05.760
what the hell is wrong with you?

730
51:06.120 --> 51:07.320
You'd better remember this.

731
51:07.760 --> 51:09.120
I'm going to kill you.

732
51:13.040 --> 51:15.600
What would I get out of being a good brother to you

733
51:16.120 --> 51:17.440
for the rest of my life?

734
51:19.240 --> 51:20.680
You'd still never care about me.

735
51:22.600 --> 51:23.520
That's why...

736
51:24.120 --> 51:25.600
I don't regret anything

737
51:26.240 --> 51:27.440
I've done,

738
51:28.640 --> 51:30.560
even if you kill me for it.

739
51:31.440 --> 51:32.640
Just you wait.

740
51:33.000 --> 51:34.080
I'm going to kill you.

741
51:34.760 --> 51:36.040
I'm going to kill you, Itt.

742
51:38.640 --> 51:40.240
The one who really deserves you

743
51:41.600 --> 51:42.440
is me,

744
51:42.920 --> 51:44.040
not that bastard Yok.

745
51:47.680 --> 51:49.120
The coordinates lead to that building.

746
52:21.320 --> 52:22.960
From now on, this area...

747
52:23.920 --> 52:25.280
will be where your first building stands.

748
52:52.000 --> 52:52.880
P'Ing...

749
52:54.320 --> 52:55.600
I love you.

750
53:00.080 --> 53:01.600
After tonight...

751
53:05.520 --> 53:07.200
You'll finally be mine.

752
53:19.760 --> 53:21.080
How could you do this?

753
53:22.120 --> 53:23.480
-Come home with me. -Let go.

754
53:26.480 --> 53:27.800
Leave me alone.

755
53:29.000 --> 53:30.240
This is Mrs. Arisara.

756
53:30.280 --> 53:32.720
She's in charge of investment and management.

757
53:32.720 --> 53:34.800
I guess P'Ing and Itt never told you

758
53:35.160 --> 53:36.560
who the real victim was.

759
53:36.640 --> 53:38.400
Just because I used to like you,

760
53:38.720 --> 53:40.120
does that mean I owe you something?

761
53:40.320 --> 53:41.920
What happened between you two?

762
53:42.120 --> 53:43.600
I'm sorry, P'Ing.

763
53:43.800 --> 53:45.520
Yok and I aren't together anymore.

764
53:45.560 --> 53:47.240
-Yok... -I love P'Ing

765
53:47.360 --> 53:48.680
so much that I can't even control myself.

766
53:51.160 --> 53:54.400
[The UNCUT version of Fool in Love]

767
53:54.440 --> 53:57.600
[is exclusively available on iQIYI and iQ.com]
